Week4_Containers_Kubernetes

Goal

Learn how to containerize and orchestrate applications.

Topics to Learn
	•	Docker: images, containers, Dockerfiles, volumes.
	•	Kubernetes: pods, deployments, services, ingress.
	•	Registries (Docker Hub, ECR, ACR, GCR).

Practice Resources

https://labs.play-with-docker.com/
https://github.com/docker/labs/tree/master/beginner
https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io/docs/start/
https://kubernetes.io/docs/tutorials/kubernetes-basics/
https://kubernetes.io/docs/tutorials/hello-minikube/

What Won’t Work

Jumping to managed Kubernetes before you’ve run Minikube locally.